ll, "display_name": "Legendary Tales", "keywords": ["Action", "Adventure", "RPG", "coop", "physics"], "long_description": "Are you ready for adventure? Collect loot, destroy enemies, learn magic, craft your own items and head out on epic quests to conquer the evil that lurks beneath the earth. Play Alone or with friends; Legendary Tales is the ultimate fantasy VR experience.\n\nAre you ready to step down into the darkness? Explore winding roads and ruined castles that will take you down to the heart of the underworld, to defeat the evil corrupting the land. But be careful down there, the road is dangerous so you best bring a friend. Traverse the landscape, Bludgeon, slice and decimate skeletons with melee weapons, sneak up on a goblin with ranged weapons or destroy a demon from afar with destructive magic.\n\nPhysics based melee combat, Improved Ai, an immersive crafting system, a myriad of weapons and up to 4 player co-op; this is an RPG, fantasy, adventure that is waiting for you to create your own Legendary Tales.\n\nhunting for weapons in the dungeons isn\u2019t for you then we have good news! You can create your own weapons with ingredients found on your adventures, or by honing the weapons you\u2019ve collected. You can also make potions to prepare deep dungeon crawling and disassemble items you found during your adventures to get ingredients and enhance your crafted weapons or potions with them.\n\nGet ready for an epic adventure in VR! Put on your headset, find some friends and head into the dungeon to start creating your own Legendary Tales.\n", "short_description": "Legendary tales is a VR Action roleplaying game with up to 4 player co-op. Collect items, enhance your abilities and fight your way through an ever changing dungeon to make your own Legendary Tales."}]}, "developer_name": "Urban Wolf Games Inc,", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://urbanwolfgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Urban Wolf Gam